evidence.text:
🚨Indic ASR Drop from 
@Adalat_AI
 🚨

We built a 244M ASR model that beats models up to 6x its size on Hindi and Malayalam.  

The secret? We broke the standard fine-tuning playbook. 
1. Instead of easy → hard, we did hard → easy. 
2. High LR to shatter the decoder’s pretrained basin. 
3. Reverse curriculum so peak plasticity hits the hardest acoustic conditions. 

The results :-  
→ Hindi: 15.73 WER vs 21.05 (Vaani Large-v3, 1.5B by 
@artparkindia
 ) 
→ Malayalam: 39.64 vs 47.96 (IndicWhisper, 769M by 
@ai4bharat
) 

Releasing Vividh-ASR + model weights openly. Link in comments.

Credits to 
@kavya_manohar
, 
@kushjuvekar
 &  Manas for shipping this in service of the mission!

